	<data name="MainMenu.Info.MainText" xml:space="preserve">
		<value>You are entering in a virtual reality simulation for medical education, using your VR headset.

This simulation represents the third step of an endovascular repair of abdominal aortic aneurysm made with the department of vascular &amp; endovascular surgery from Stanford Medicine. It is highly recommended to do the first two consultations before doing this one. Do not forget the fourth consultation to finish the training.

During this simulation, you will play the role of a medical doctor. You will do the ultrasound guided femoral access before the stent implantation.</value>
